  "description": "Fail-closed fluent OData client for Microsoft Dynamics 365 Finance and Operations and Dataverse. Provides strongly typed LINQ queries, CRUD responses, typed failures, validated pagination, named clients, and shared token management for Azure AD, Managed Identity, and ADFS.",
