  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.1.0 adds explicit System-assigned and User-assigned Azure Managed Identity authentication through the fluent API, shared MSAL caching, force refresh after an actual D365 HTTP 401, and typed token-acquisition failures. Client-secret Azure AD and ADFS authentication remain supported with no automatic fallback. Authentication guide: https://github.com/FlintsLabs/FlintsLabs.D365.ODataClient/blob/main/docs/v2/authentication-and-parallelism.md",
